# Shaped like the test fleet's Windows PC: GeForce RTX 5070 Ti (16 GB, driver
# 610.62 — step 0's values), plus the graphics built into a Ryzen 7000
# processor and a Parsec virtual display, which must be filtered out. The
# PowerShell section is winProbeScript's output format. CPU, RAM and IDs are
# chosen, not captured.
-- env --
SystemRoot=C:\Windows
ProgramFiles=C:\Program Files
USERPROFILE=C:\Users\itay
-- exists --
C:\Windows\System32\WindowsPowerShell\v1.0\powershell.exe
C:\Windows\System32\nvidia-smi.exe
-- $ powershell -NoProfile --
